# The portal Worker proxies opensource.unisim.co.uk/painter/* to this Worker
# with the /painter prefix intact, while the build output is flat. All 200s —
# transparent rewrites, not redirects.
#
# ⚠️ NO catch-all `/painter/* /index.html 200` rule — Workers static assets
# rejects it as an infinite loop. Unmatched paths fall through to
# `not_found_handling: single-page-application`, which serves index.html anyway.
#
# ⚠️ SO EVERY NEW FILE AT THE ROOT OF public/ NEEDS A LINE HERE. Without one it
# deploys, answers 200 on workers.dev, and is index.html on the real site.
/painter/sw.js                /sw.js                200
/painter/registerSW.js        /registerSW.js        200
/painter/manifest.webmanifest /manifest.webmanifest 200
/painter/workbox-*            /workbox-:splat       200
/painter/assets/*             /assets/:splat        200
/painter/favicon.svg          /favicon.svg          200
/painter/unisim-icon.png      /unisim-icon.png      200
/painter/icon-180.png         /icon-180.png         200
/painter/icon-192.png         /icon-192.png         200
/painter/icon-512.png         /icon-512.png         200
/painter/robots.txt           /robots.txt           200
/painter/sitemap.xml          /sitemap.xml          200
